skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F3F6
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #111827
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9A5B13
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam NoteFontColor #111827

participant "Business service / Edge event listener" as Business
database "PostgreSQL edge_event" as Events
participant "DefaultTbClusterService" as Cluster
queue "TB Core notification" as Queue
participant "AppActor / TenantActor" as Actors
participant "EdgeGrpcService" as Service
participant "EdgeGrpcSession" as Session
participant "Edge client" as Edge
database "Server attributes cursor" as Cursor

Business -> Events: insert EdgeEvent after entity change
Events --> Cluster: save future success
Cluster -> Queue: onEdgeEventUpdate(edgeId)
Queue -> Actors: EdgeEventUpdateMsg
Actors -> Service: onToEdgeSessionMsg(msg)
Service -> Service: edge-service.execute
Service -> Service: sessionNewEvents[edgeId] = true
Service -> Session: processEdgeEvents()
Session -> Cursor: find(queueStartTs, queueStartSeqId)
Cursor --> Session: cursor pair
Session -> Events: fetch page after cursor
Events --> Session: List<EdgeEvent>
Session -> Session: convertToDownlinkMsgsPack
Session -> Session: pendingMsgsMap.put(downlinkMsgId, msg)
Session -> Edge: ResponseMsg.downlinkMsg
Edge -> Edge: apply entity/action
Edge --> Session: DownlinkResponse(success=true, id)
Session -> Session: pendingMsgsMap.remove(id)
Session -> Cursor: save new queueStartTs/queueStartSeqId
Cursor --> Session: Future success
Session --> Service: processEdgeEvents future completes

note over Session,Cursor
Sending, Edge ACK and cursor persistence are not one transaction.
Crash before cursor save can replay the page.
end note
@enduml

@startuml
title 44.4 Full Sync request and fetcher chain

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
